  "description": "CR 122.1, 603.10a, 613.4c: Toxrill, the Corrosive puts a slime counter on each creature its controller doesn't control at each end step, shrinks them by their slime counters, makes a Slug when one with a slime counter dies, and sacrifices a Slug to draw",
  "note": "alice's own slimed Grizzly Bears keeps its 2/2 and makes no Slug when bolted; carol's counterless Llanowar Elves makes none either. At alice's end step bob's Hill Giant reaches two slime counters (1/1) and carol's Memnite dies with one, making a Slug; at bob's end step the Giant dies with three, making a second. Toxrill gets no counter. On turn 4 alice sacrifices a Slug token to draw Giant Growth.",
